<title>USA: AMEX to list Sabratek options on July 11.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Sabratek options on July 11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange will list options on Sabratek Corp on July 11, the exchange said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The options will open with strike prices of 22-1/2, 25 and 30, with position limits of 4,500 contracts. Initial expirations will be in August, September, November and February.</p>
<p>Group One Trading LP will be the specialist unit, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Sabratek options will also be available at the Pacific Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
